  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "社會永續與創新創業",
    "sub_ename": "SOCIAL SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT AND INNOVATION AND ENTREPRENEURSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "面對地球暖化永續發展的議題，逐漸成為企業家所需面對的問題，對於新創事業，更需朝向這個議題發展，從企業的CSR，ESG出發，成為永續發展議題的新創事業。課程中會探討社會企業、社會創新、暖化議題、SDGs、ESG、CSR，從商業模式圖找出價值主張，提出一份執行的營運計畫。",
    "describe_eh": "The issue of sustainable development of global warming has gradually become a problem that entrepreneurs need to face. For new businesses, it is necessary to develop towards this issue. Starting from the CSR and ESG of enterprises, the issue of sustainable development has become a new innovation. The course will discuss social enterprises, social innovation, warming issues, SDGs, ESG, CSR, and find out the value proposition from the business model diagram, and propose an operational plan for implementation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
